Subject: radio-v2: the checked radio is an accent ring around an accent dot

What: a checked radio-v2 control keeps the base background inside a 1.5px accent ring and draws an 8px accent dot; the grey 6px indicator and its shadow are gone, and a hovered checked radio takes the plain hover overlay.
Why: an accent-filled disc with a small grey dot read as an avatar rather than a chosen option, in light and dark themes alike.

